WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.730
There are a lot of things in life worth caring
about.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.990
Things we consider important and meaningful.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.540
Things that affect the narrative of our lives.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.560
But beneath all the things that construct
our narratives, the one thing a human should

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:24.339
take most seriously in life, is not taking
life too seriously.

00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:26.859
Life is simply too complicated.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:32.309
It is too far out of our comprehension to
claim it as something that we can take as

00:00:32.309 --> 00:00:36.180
seriously as many of us often do.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:41.020
We could very well be characters in some intricate
simulation.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:46.870
We could very well be the most intelligent
life forms in the universe, prospective gods

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:50.080
to those that reside beneath us.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:55.830
We could very well be living a reality that
is merely a projection of each of our own

00:00:55.830 --> 00:01:00.650
individual consciousness, with no root in
objective truth.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:07.680
Or we could be nothing more than a collectively
evolving bacteria, destine to feed off the

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:16.409
planets of the universe, with zero purpose
or benefit to anything outside of our selves.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:23.020
Some possibilities regarding our existence
bare a bleak outlook for humanity.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:26.520
Others suggest promising idealistic ones.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:31.610
Either way, we do not know and we may never
know.

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:39.430
Therefore, we must not let trivial inconveniences
and troubles affect us too much in life.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:45.740
Because what a shame it would be to live a
life filled with stress, worry, and concern

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:51.060
for things that end up not even being real
or important.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.350
Things we could have chosen to ignore.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:02:01.709
Would it not be the safer bet to work towards
enjoying life, floating with the tides, adapting

00:02:01.709 --> 00:02:08.789
to new situations, and not letting things
ruin our ability to embrace life’s profound

00:02:08.789 --> 00:02:10.670
mystery?

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:16.940
It is important that we care about the things
that we deem relevant and meaningful in life,

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:23.140
but it is equally important to live with the
acknowledgement that it could all just be

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.150
illusory.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:31.390
Nothing more than a crazy dream or trip of
the mind, with no real relevance or stake

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:36.400
in anything beyond the mere experience of
it.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:44.280
And the best way to embrace this and maximize
the experience is to try our best to be lighthearted

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.870
and fluid.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:03:19.430
To laugh at our problems so we can cry tears
of joy over life’s wonder.

